\newlabel{fig:alt-profile-comparison}{{13}{8}{Alternative Market Profile Robustness Check. One-sided book fraction vs $\phi $ under the primary configuration (RMSC04: 80 noise traders, 2 market makers) and the alternative configuration (ZIC: 51 ZIC traders, 15 market makers). The alternative profile produces zero one-sided failures across all $\phi $ values, demonstrating that the failure mode depends on limited market maker coverage}{figure.caption.15}{}}
